值就合并进返回的替换配置。启动时若发现残留的 `mode: 'hot'` 值会清空（热调语义）。\n- **Client**（`dist/client.js`）：`window.__Modul"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"eLoader__.load({ id, factory })` 浏览器 bundle，经 `connection.api.settings.describe/update/replace` 读写命名"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"oad({ id, factory })` 浏览器 bundle，经 `connection.api.settings.describe/update/replace` 读写命名空间，渲染按钮与弹层。"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 安装 / Install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Out-of-tree bundle（GitHub 直装，无需 npm 账号）："},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"> 本包自带 `dsh.client` 元数据与 `exports[\"./client\"]`，客户端 bundle 随页面加载自动注入；无需 npm publish。"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## 文件结构 / Files"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## 已知限制 / Limitations"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- 拦截器只在插件运行期间生效；值通过 settings 持久化，卸载插件后不再注入。\n- `LlmCallConfig` 抽象层只暴露 `temperature` / `maxTokens` / `"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"stop`（无 `top_p`），故滑杆做这两个字段。"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
